  "notes": "Near-black (#08090a) Linear marketing homepage. Almost all imagery is live-DOM product mockups, not bitmaps: the app shell, issue view and agent panel, a Slack thread, the kanban board, roadmap, scatter chart, agent panels and code diff. They fade out at the edges with gradient masks and sit on #0f1011 surfaces with 1px hairlines and 12px radii. The patterns coded from these mockups are depictions; the hero sidebar only highlights on click and does not navigate. The page's own interactive UI is the hover mega-menu, the Features + buttons that open a right drawer (TECH SPECS), pill buttons and text links with arrows. Sections are split by full-width hairlines, with a 2-column heading/blurb layout. The only saturated color is the lime Ramp testimonial and a pastel gradient OpenAI card; accents inside the mockups are status colors and the teal data dots. The customer logo strip and testimonials have no codebook entry; I filed a proposal (social-proof)."
